t cousin."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l006","ordinal":265929,"en":"Indeed, cousin, if it is you,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l007","ordinal":265930,"en":"Sing out what you have to say,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l008","ordinal":265931,"en":"Speak your truth as plainly as your creed!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l009","ordinal":265932,"en":"So spoke Külchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l010","ordinal":265933,"en":"Ready even to sacrifice his life"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l011","ordinal":265934,"en":"And endure affliction;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l012","ordinal":265935,"en":"The warrior, formidable in speech,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l013","ordinal":265936,"en":"Was also mighty in strength."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l014","ordinal":265937,"en":"When that noble man grew wrathful,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l015","ordinal":265938,"en":"He also had steadfast courage."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l016","ordinal":265939,"en":"The peerless one who knew the enemy’s schemes"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l017","ordinal":265940,"en":"Also possessed a lion’s valor."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l018","ordinal":265941,"en":"Ümötöy, son of Köksö,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l019","ordinal":265942,"en":"Was asking after Sary-Arka,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l020","ordinal":265943,"en":"His ancestral homeland;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l021","ordinal":265944,"en":"He was asking after the Kazakh people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l022","ordinal":265945,"en":"The nation of the Three Hordes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l023","ordinal":265946,"en":"There among them, Ümötöy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l024","ordinal":265947,"en":"Was asking after their lord;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l025","ordinal":265948,"en":"He was asking after the people"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l026","ordinal":265949,"en":"In heeled boots and leather trousers."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l027","ordinal":265950,"en":"Ümötöy, son of Köksö,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l028","ordinal":265951,"en":"Stiffened in anger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l029","ordinal":265952,"en":"As though he would reap and sack them,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l030","ordinal":265953,"en":"Bent on their destruction."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l031","ordinal":265954,"en":"As though to store them for provisions,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l032","ordinal":265955,"en":"As though he had reaped their barley unripe,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l033","ordinal":265956,"en":"As though gray-maned Manas"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l034","ordinal":265957,"en":"Had seized and slaughtered his father Köksö,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l035","ordinal":265958,"en":"His anger changed his countenance;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l036","ordinal":265959,"en":"Ümötöy flew into a rage,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l037","ordinal":265960,"en":"Like one about to enter battle."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l038","ordinal":265961,"en":"Mustering his courage and fury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b003:l039","ordinal":265962,"en":"He said this to Külchoro:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l001","ordinal":265963,"en":"“If you speak of lords, I am a lord’s son,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l002","ordinal":265964,"en":"One of the highborn princes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l003","ordinal":265965,"en":"I am the dark eye of a surging spring,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l004","ordinal":265966,"en":"One who rejoices at the call to combat—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l005","ordinal":265967,"en":"I am Khan Ümötöy himself."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l006","ordinal":265968,"en":"Not merely Ümötöy, but Köksö’s"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l007","ordinal":265969,"en":"Deep-dark, watchful eye."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l008","ordinal":265970,"en":"Finding no mountain to charge,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l009","ordinal":265971,"en":"Finding no foe to fight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l010","ordinal":265972,"en":"I have worn out horses ranging the land,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l011","ordinal":265973,"en":"And worn out coats while taking heroes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l012","ordinal":265974,"en":"Do not draw out your words;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l013","ordinal":265975,"en":"Having devoured my father, brave Köksö,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l014","ordinal":265976,"en":"Do not speak evasively,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l015","ordinal":265977,"en":"Thinking you have a sorcerous slave."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l016","ordinal":265978,"en":"You skulking slave whose life is spent,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l017","ordinal":265979,"en":"We have come to call you to account."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l018","ordinal":265980,"en":"Meeting upon the open plain,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l019","ordinal":265981,"en":"We have heard these words from you."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l020","ordinal":265982,"en":"You battered madman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l021","ordinal":265983,"en":"Today we have seen your face."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1031:b004:l022","ordinal":265984,"en":"Meat tastes sweet when shot and eaten—"}]
